] The Orb of Fate                      crystal ball   V    level teleport*
] wielded: Increase Luck
] carried: Warning
]    1/2 spell damage to player
]    1/2 physical damage to player
]    (Neutral)
] 
]    *allows you to teleport to the first levels of the different branches 
]    of the dungeon (doom, mines, quest, gehennom, vlad's tower) which you 
]    have already found.
] 
] After invoking them, all these items will have a 'time out' (which isn't  
] too long). You can pick up all these items wearing a helm of opp. al. but  
] you will feel a blast of power. once you have them (or wield them) you can  
] change your alignm.

So the easiest way would be to invoke the Orb of Fate. Alternatively,
you could try to remember what the spot was where you originally
arrived at Norn's level. To get to Norn, you activated a magic
transporter and arrived at some place at Norn's level. You'll find the
way back at exactly that spot.


